  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">for support of the Africa Care Community of Practice</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Canada&#x2019;s International Development Research Centre (IDRC) and Global Affairs Canada launched the Scaling Care Innovations in Africa initiative in 2023. The initiative aims to scale tested solutions to redress the disproportionate share of responsibility for unpaid care work that falls on women and girls. This project grant will support the Africa Care Community of Practice, one of the initiative&apos;s three pillars. (Strategy: International Women&#x2019;s Economic Empowerment)</narrative>
  </description>
